        "x1": 476.93,
        "y1": 117.45
      },
      "text": "Dr. Guang Chen is Assistant Professor in the School of Educational Technology, Faculty of Education, Beijing Normal University. His current research interest is cognitive development in information age and smart learning environments.",
      "text_sha256": "deb80745cbccb4a30a20767d4ee2d70b39b68974c3143c1ccc4b3516c351b2e6"
    },
    {
