        "x0": 116.64,
        "y0": 134.94,
        "x1": 472.4,
        "y1": 153.45
      },
      "text": "Manli Lu is a Master in the School of Educational Technology, Faculty of Education, Beijing Normal University. Her current research interest is online synchronous learning and smart learning environments.",
      "text_sha256": "3a71627ea7830b61ecb75b6b90f6509f05e016a21da23af070a15eac6e73865f"
    },
    {
