        "x0": 116.64,
        "y0": 152.96,
        "x1": 476.25,
        "y1": 180.44
      },
      "text": "Dr. Nian-Shing Chen is Chair Professor in the Department of Information Management at the National Sun Yat-sen University, Taiwan. His current research interests include assessing e-Learning course performance; online synchronous teaching & learning; mobile & ubiquitous learning; Natural user interface & Game-based learning.",
